  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed outbuilding by reason of its siting, scale and design, would dominate the rear garden of the site and detract from the open character of the rear garden environment, failing to appear as a subordinate garden addition,  harming the character and appearance of Bartholomew Estate Conservation area and detracting from the visual amenity of neighbouring occupiers.  It would therefore be contrary to Policies A1, D1 and D2 of the Camden Local Plan 2017 and policy D3 of the Kentish Town Neighbourhood Plan 2000."
